      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然不太清楚详情……\n总之如果想挑战成田白仁，\n似乎就得完成这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fff534676e010628692346c86a5ac0c511192ca7b02330d3ba8cad8d27e909ee",
