      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊一口气冲上坡道。\n那天起，她持续过着增量训练的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6a8df92e88932571c1359fc9bb996cc06564381b9856cc9613dc5dd923cc5dc",
