      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后到了天皇赏（秋）。\n虽然媒体报导了成田白仁状态不佳，\n但是观众还是对她寄予厚望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782b337eb61d82b25821e2389bf13a14f378a4b7ae3a3fe0f21ade2d17adb83e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
